  "changes": [
    "Normalize operator home prefix to ~ in historical receipts and authored research.",
    "Replace raw OOM/journal lines with minimal structured failure/resource facts; omit machine/session/process identities and unrelated workload locations.",
    "Preserve measurements, error classifications, timestamps, source/event digests, synthetic event identities and explicit unknowns.",
    "Pseudonymize per-user cgroup prefixes and agent-session scope identities in five resource/friction receipts; preserve same-vs-distinct scope relationships and measurements.",
    "Omit historical admission, review-session and monitor run handles; retain original bytes privately. These identities are distinct from synthetic event identities and source hashes.",
    "Pseudonymize six exact systemd invocation handles with explicit labels tied to their redacted session scopes, preserving relationships and resource facts."
  ],
